  "type": "accessory",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTqvTroOuDAxW9FLkGHVHWCfsQ3ewLegQIBRAQ\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">Assassinate, Opening Gambit, and Maestro Echo you have acquired are treated as having +1 SR (they may exceed the maximum SR). This item cannot be equipped on two or more at the same time. [CR12] The effect of increasing SR by 1 is invalidated.</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTqvTroOuDAxW9FLkGHVHWCfsQ3ewLegQIBRAQ\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">A talisman worn by soldiers fighting on the front lines. It contains magic that eases the fear of battle and allows you to demonstrate more power than usual.</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Small piece of rotten silver [core material] (30G) +&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Aoi's amulet (60G) +</p>\n<p>[Magic Catalyst 2] (20G) x 3 +</p>\n<p>Crafting Cost (80G)</p>",
